units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
region box block 0 20 0 20 0 20 units box
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 random 100 94211 box
mass 1 183.84
pair_style zero 4.76
pair_coeff * *
velocity all create 100.0 72341 mom yes rot no dist gaussian
fix integrator all nve
fix thermostat all langevin 1000.0 1000.0 0.1 123456 tally yes
timestep 0.0001
thermo 200
thermo_style custom step temp ke f_thermostat etotal
run 2000
